 "words": 170,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Ten young girls with their lamps all ready",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Waiting for the wedding night",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Five of them were foolish, five of them were wise",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Five brought oil to keep their lamps alight",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The bridegroom was a long time in coming",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So they all grew drowsy and fell asleep",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But at midnight there came a shout",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the wise ones had their oil to keep",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Here is the bridegroom",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Come out to meet him",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep your lamp burning",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep watch, keep watch",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Give us some of your oil, our lamps are going out",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The foolish ones cried, but the wise ones said no",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "While they were away the bridegroom came",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the door was shut, and they had nowhere to go",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Here is the bridegroom",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Come out to meet him",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep your lamp burning",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep watch, keep watch",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So keep watch",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
